sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Depositor
    participant V as Exeunt Vault
    participant M as Exit market
    participant P as Lending pool
    participant K as Anyone
    D->>V: Deposit WETH or USDG
    V->>M: Bid at 3%, up to 20% of capital
    Note over V,M: A freeze: sellers sell to the bid
    M->>V: Receipts, below face value
    K->>V: Trigger recovery once the pool refills
    V->>P: Redeem the receipts
    P->>V: The underlying, at full value
    D->>V: Withdraw any time: idle now, receipts in kind
